            </div>
          </th>
          <th>
            <div class="journey-step-header">
              <img class="is-ratio-3-2" src="images/journey_lp_illustration.png" alt="接点2のイラスト">
              <div class="step-num">Interest</div>
              <div class="step-title">興味を持つ</div>
            </div>
          </th>
          <th>
            <div class="journey-step-header">
              <img src="images/journey_desire_illustration.png" alt="接点3のイラスト">
              <div class="step-num">Desire</div>
              <div class="step-title">頼みたくなる</div>
            </div>
          </th>
          <th>
            <div class="journey-step-header">
              <img src="images/journey_memory_illustration.png" alt="接点4のイラスト">
              <div class="step-num">Memory</div>
              <div class="step-title">候補に残す</div>
            </div>
          </th>
          <th>
            <div class="journey-step-header">
              <img src="images/journey_cta_illustration.png" alt="接点5のイラスト">
